15:["$","p","We are providing our service since 2013. SKY SECURE brings your systems together. We design, build and maintain stand-alone and integrated security systems. We have the ability to provide full turnkey solutions: taking a customerâ€™s requirements, designing and developing the concept, selecting the product that best fits the requirements, and completing the installation.",{"children":"We are providing our service since 2013. SKY SECURE brings your systems together. We design, build and maintain stand-alone and integrated security systems. We have the ability to provide full turnkey solutions: taking a customerâ€™s requirements, designing and developing the concept, selecting the product that best fits the requirements, and completing the installation."}]
16:["$","p","SKY SECURE expertise helps establish our customers as industry leaders, working with them to build standards and exceed compliance regulations, improve lives, and develop future economic opportunities. To do this, we provide commercial, industrial and government clients with a single source of expertise for all their security needs.",{"children":"SKY SECURE expertise helps establish our customers as industry leaders, working with them to build standards and exceed compliance regulations, improve lives, and develop future economic opportunities. To do this, we provide commercial, industrial and government clients with a single source of expertise for all their security needs."}]
17:["$","p","From development and design through installation and ongoing maintenance, we are a true partner, creating sustainable solutions that exceed expectations now and for many years to come.",{"children":"From development and design through installation and ongoing maintenance, we are a true partner, creating sustainable solutions that exceed expectations now and for many years to come."}]
